+## What is new in 0.3.0 (delivery safety)
+
+| Command | What it adds |
+|---|---|
+| `patentkit export-docx <TGT>` | Renders the workspace state into an editable .docx search report — zero hand-typed numbers; optional extra `pip install "patentkit[docx]"` |
+| `patentkit map <TGT>` | Offline self-contained HTML overview (gates / per-axis coverage / D-list); no network, no scripts |
+| `patentkit layout` | Cross-target 1+N portfolio view with a primary-filing suggestion (read-only) |
+| `patentkit ledger [TGT]` | Evidence ledger — the citable-fact table behind every conclusion; V034 rejects conclusions citing IDs outside it |
+| `patentkit provenance scan/check` | Numerical-claim A/B/C source registry (V031/V032): every number in the manuscript must trace to in-house material, a retrieved document, or a declared example |
+| `patentkit figures check/draw` | Figure-mark bidirectional consistency (V033, warn-only) + deterministic SVG block diagrams |
+| `patentkit deadlines list/check/init` | Post-filing statutory-deadline ledger — refuses to compute without a base date; the official document always prevails |
 
