-## Common commands
-
-```powershell
-pip install -e ".[mcp,dev]"        # editable install of the core + dev dependencies
-python -m pytest                    # rule regression tests
-python -m patentkit check           # CI entry point: validate + gates
-python -m patentkit status          # everything at a glance: targets/gates/validation/candidates/next steps
-python -m patentkit validate --strict
-python -m patentkit gates
-
-python tools/snapshot.py --write    # refresh docs/delivery_summary.md
-python tools/build_skill_release.py # build the skill package zip (dist/)
-```
