-
-## Confidentiality boundary review (2026-10-21)
-
-**Conclusion: the repository must stay private; external distribution covers only code and the skill package.**
-**Review premise: GitHub repository visibility = Private (user-confirmed, 2026-10-21).**
-
-| Level | Scope | Notes |
-|---|---|---|
-| ✅ **Already public** | `07_granted_patents/` (public-status registry only) | Both patents have been granted and published; the full texts have been moved out of the repository, leaving only the registry table and sha256 |
-| ⚠️ **Internal · includes derived content from unpublished applications** | `00_methodology/`, `01_search_plan/`, `04_comparative_analysis/`, `05_novelty_conclusions/`, `07_drafting/`, `08_polishing/`, `docs/delivery_summary.md`, `workspace.yml` | TGT-0001 is not yet published; its title, technical main axes, feature-level summaries, parameters and conclusions all live here. Full texts are outside this repo |
-| ✅ **Directly distributable** | `patentkit/`, `patent-research-skill/`, `release/`, `tools/` | Code and skill package contain no project data |
-
-**Must comply**
-
-1. Do not make the repository public; do not package the whole repository for external distribution (archives / network drives / cloud-sync folders all count as external distribution).
-2. Do not upload `00–08` or `docs/delivery_summary.md` to cloud AI clients; `patentkit/` and `patent-research-skill/` are fine.
-3. Distribute only the skill package and `patentkit/` externally; keep workspace data on the local machine.
-4. Before delivery / external distribution, tick off each item in the "Pre-delivery/public-disclosure · confidentiality checklist" in [`docs/operations_manual.md`](docs/operations_manual.md).
-
-## Language policy
-
-- The **documentation, code, tests, configuration and the skill package are written in English.**
-- **Workspace data is archived in its original language (Chinese) and is intentionally not translated**:
-  search-log evidence (`02_search_logs/`), candidate records (`03_candidates/`), review worksheets
-  (`05_novelty_conclusions/review/`), citation data (`06_citation_management/`), raw cross-client evidence
-  (`cross_client_tests/evidence/`), and the data values of `00_methodology/glossary.yml`,
-  `01_search_plan/query_library.yml` and `07_drafting/manuscript_registry.yml`. These are primary records;
-  translating them would destroy the audit trail.
-- Docs that reference **real out-of-repo local paths, manuscript file names or person names** keep those
-  strings verbatim for the same reason.
-- Tests keep a few Chinese input fixtures where the code under test parses Chinese data (CNIPA pages,
-  Chinese CSV headers, CJK title normalization).
-- `01_search_plan/` keeps **bilingual reference tables**: the `Chinese name` columns (axis names from
-  `00_methodology/glossary.yml`) and the `Chinese query` columns / code blocks (original CNIPA query strings
-  from `01_search_plan/query_library.yml`) stay in Chinese, because the searches must be run with the
-  original Chinese query strings. The surrounding prose is English.
-- Git commit messages from before 2026-10-22 are historical and are not rewritten.
